IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. PROG-MULTI-LORA-ROUTER-V11.

DATA DIVISION.
01 TOROID-X            PIC 9(9) USAGE R0.
01 TOROID-Y            PIC 9(9) USAGE R1.
01 JITTER-NS           PIC 9(9) USAGE R2.
01 THROUGHPUT-TOKS     PIC 9(9) USAGE R3.

PROCEDURE DIVISION.
MAIN-ROUTER-V11.
    IF TOROID-X == 0 OR TOROID-Y == 0
        GO TO ERROR-EXIT.
    END-IF.

    MOVE 4 TO JITTER-NS.
    MOVE 37800 TO THROUGHPUT-TOKS.

    SET depth 3.
    WEIGHT 32 TOROID-X.
    WEIGHT 30 THROUGHPUT-TOKS.
    EVAL.
    PRUNE 15.
    GO TO END-STRATEGY.

ERROR-EXIT.
    SET depth 0.
    EVAL.

END-STRATEGY.
